{
  "metadata": {
    "title": "TALON-7",
    "author": "Robin McManus",
    "created": "2026-03-05T23:08:47.198Z",
    "draft": "MovieShaker (Imported)",
    "page_count": 19
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "transition",
      "text": "FADE IN:"
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "1",
      "text": "INT. FARMHOUSE - KITCHEN - MORNING"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The mood in the kitchen is a tense silence. Sarah and Kade sit at the table, coffee cups in front of them. Both staring at Sarah's phone lying on the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "No notifications."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The clock on the wall reads 8:47 AM."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Mr. Whiskers sits on the window sill, grooming himself, indifferent to the tension."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nothing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How long has it been?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fourteen hours since I sent it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah hesitates, picks up her phone, checks it again, sets it back down."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe they thought it was a joke."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Or maybe they don't care."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Or maybe they're smart enough NOT to respond to a cryptic message from someone they've never actually met."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Kade stands, walks towards the window, looks out at the field where Talon-7 sits exposed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The ship. It's too visible, we have to hide it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You said it couldn't fly."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "2."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It has enough power for one short flight, do you think the ship will fit inside the barn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Probably. Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Prying eyes. Satellites. Drones. The longer it sits in the open, the higher the risk someone notices."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You want to move it now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "If we wait much longer, there may not be enough power to move it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah considers this, then nods."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let me clear some equipment out of the barn first."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I have located a potential charging solution."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Both Kade and Sarah turn to look at the AI device."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Charging solution?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The barn structure contains electrical systems. Primitive but functional. With modifications, I can adapt the ship's intake coupling to accept local power grid energy. Conversion efficiency will be low but sufficient."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You're saying you can charge an alien spaceship using the barn's electrical outlet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "With modifications, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "3."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How long?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Full power restoration: impossible with available resources. Adequate combat functionality: seventy two to ninety six hours of continuous charging."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Three to four days."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(calculating)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That still leaves us ten days for training. If anyone shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "An uncomfortable silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let's move the ship. We deal with one problem at a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "2",
      "text": "INT. FARMHOUSE - LIVING ROOM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They walk through the living room toward the door. Sarah grabs keys from a hook."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Her phone, CHIMES."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Both freeze."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah runs back, grabs the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "One of them responded. Void_Hunter."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She reads the message, frowning."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He says he wants to meet, er, to make sure I'm okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That's good ... isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "4."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He also says the other two think I'm either drunk or having a nervous breakdown. he says they are not interested."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So we have one. (shrugs) That's a start."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe!"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She types a quick response, hits send."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I told him to come this afternoon at two o'clock."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then we should move the ship before he arrives."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "3",
      "text": "EXT. FIELD - TALON-7 - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Kade and Sarah approach the ship. It looks even more battered in daylight, its hull is badly scorched with signs of visible damage, but still, undeniably advanced."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Kade opens the airlock with a palm scan."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "4",
      "text": "INT. TALON-7 COCKPIT - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The interior is dark, minimal power. Kade slides into the pilot seat, activates emergency systems. Displays flicker to life."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( mutters )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Power reserves at one percent. This is going to be close."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Through the cockpit window, he sees Sarah watching."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(into comm)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Clear the barn. I'll bring her in."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "5."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "5",
      "text": "EXT. FIELD - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ship's engines WHINE to life, not the roar from before, but a struggling hum, Talon-7 lifts slowly, wobbling slightly."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah watches, holding her breath."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ship moves forward, low and careful, towards the barn."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "6",
      "text": "INT. BARN - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah has pushed equipment aside, creating a space barely large enough for the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The barn doors are wide open."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Talon-7 appears in the doorway, edging in carefully, the fit is tight, less than a meter clearance on either side."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ship settles onto the barn floor with a heavy THUD. The engines die. Silence."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "7",
      "text": "EXT. BARN - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Kade emerges from the airlock."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Power reserves at one percent."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But we made it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Barely."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah closes the barn doors."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The AI can start working on a charging solution. We have ..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She checks her phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "an hour before Void_Hunter arrives."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Enough time to think about what we're going to tell him."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "6."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You mean how we're going to lie to him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Do you want to tell him the truth? That you're harboring an inter- dimensional refugee?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No. But ... I'm not good at lying."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You won't have to, I'll handle it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They head back into the farmhouse."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "8",
      "text": "INT. FARMHOUSE - KITCHEN - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah paces anxiously. Kade sits at the table."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What if he doesn't believe us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( shrugs )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then he doesn't believe us."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What if he tells people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( smirks )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He could but who would believe him?"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah stops pacing, considers this."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fair point."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A car approaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah looks out the window."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That's him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I recognize his car."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "7."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You actually know him? Not just online?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(hesitant)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We ... er ... dated. Two years ago. Before I moved out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Interesting."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Confusing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And now he's showing up at your farm."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Apparently."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "They watch as MARCUS gets out of the car."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I should talk to him alone first."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Probably better, I'll wait in the guest room."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Heads toward the hallway."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A KNOCK on the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah takes a deep breath, opens it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "MARCUS (late 20s, concerned expression) stands on the porch. He looks relieved to see her."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sarah."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marcus."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "An awkward pause."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah. Of course."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "8."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "9",
      "text": "INT. FARMHOUSE - LIVING ROOM - CONTINUOUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus enters, looking around, Sarah closes the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It's good to see you, you haven't changed."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( shrugs )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why would I?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don't know. It's been two years."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Another awkward beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Look, your message. The stuff about a spacecraft and a simulator ... Are you okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I'm fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Because Phantom and Stardust thought you were maybe drunk or having some sort of breakdown."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know how it sounds."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So? Why did you send the message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Because it's true."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus studies her face."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yes, of course, why shouldn't I be serious."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Sarah, this is not real, spaceships aren't ..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "A SOUND from the hallway as Kade walks in."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "9."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I'm sorry. I should introduce myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus immediately tenses, stepping slightly in front of Sarah."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who the hell is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marcus, this is Kade. He's ..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She looks at Kade, unsure how to finish."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(extending hand)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Commander Kade. Military, we are working on a classified project."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus doesn't shake the hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( sneers )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Classified project, here, on Sarah's farm."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That's correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to Sarah)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It's complicated."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Try me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Kade and Sarah exchange a glance."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The government has developed a new training simulator. Virtual reality, next-generation technology. Sarah mentioned you and your friends are exceptional at combat flight games. We're looking for someone to test the simulator."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "10."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "To evaluate the simulator's effectiveness with civilian users."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And the spacecraft?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Part of the simulation. We built a full scale mock-up. Adds to the immersion experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus looks at them, clearly skeptical."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This sounds insane."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Why would the military set up a secret simulator on Sarah's farm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Isolated location. Low population density. Minimal risk of exposure."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And Sarah just, well, agreed to this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(interjects)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The compensation was good."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus processes this, still suspicious but uncertain."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And why would the others believe me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The simulators in the barn."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "10",
      "text": "INT. BARN - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The barn doors open. Marcus steps inside, Sarah and Kade behind him."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He stops dead, staring at Talon-7."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The ship dominates the barn, sleek and beautiful, clearly not from any Earth manufacturer."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "11."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(stunned)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What the hell is that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "The simulator environment. Built to exact specifications of the next-generation fighter craft."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus walks slowly around it, reaching out but not quite touching."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is... this is... incredible."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, it's pretty impressive."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( inspecting )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The detail, the structure, I've never seen anything like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He looks back at Kade."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How much did this cost to build?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It was expensive, but, that's classified information."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Your telling me."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He continues circling the ship, eyes wide."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can I see inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Not today, the systems are still being calibrated but if you can convince your friends to participate..."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus's attitude has now completely changed, a mixture of awe and shock."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah, yeah, I think I can."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He pulls out his phone, takes a photo of the ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "12."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No photos."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Security protocols."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then how do I prove to Phantom and Stardust that this is all real?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Tell them you saw it, if they don't believe you, they can come see for themselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus reluctantly deletes the photo."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "They're going to think I'm having whatever breakdown you're having."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(to Kade)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What's your actual goal?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Combat simulation fidelity. Response time. Tactical decision-making under pressure. Whether civilian gamers can match or exceed military pilot performance."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And if we're good enough?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( sly smile )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You'll be part of the crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Okay. Okay, I'll talk to them."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "11",
      "text": "INT. FARMHOUSE - LIVING ROOM - DAY"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Marcus prepares to leave. Sarah walks him to the door. Kade hangs back, giving them space."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "13."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(quietly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Are you sure you're okay? With all of this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I'm fine, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Because if you need anything ..."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know. Thank you for coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Yeah. I'll call Phantom and Stardust tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He glances back at Kade, then at Sarah."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "This is weird, Sarah, really weird."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARCUS"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But that ship... that's the most amazing thing I've ever seen."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "He leaves. Sarah closes the door, leans against it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Kade approaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "So, seems like you already know each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It was a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He cares about you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We're just friends now. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Beat."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Is he going to try to convince the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "14."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Maybe."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And if he succeeds?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then we have a crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She moves to the couch, sits heavily."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We just lied to him, about everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We gave him a version he could accept."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It's still lying."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Would you prefer to tell him the truth? That in sixteen days, I'm flying back through a wormhole to almost certain death?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "When do we tell them the truth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The day before we leave, if they all agree to help, we tell them everything, then, they can make their decision."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And if they don't want to go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then I go alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah stares at the floor."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I don't like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Neither do I, but we're out of good options."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Marcus had an idea, before he left."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "15."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What kind of idea?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Use the game to build a replica of your ship in the game's custom build module, then, get Phantom and Stardust to fly it online and see how it works."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It might make the real thing less overwhelming."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Can you do that? Build an accurate replica in the game?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "With the AI's help? Probably."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(from nearby)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Affirmative. I can provide exact specifications, translate them to game parameters."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "See? We can start tonight."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How long until they're ready?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "In the game? Could be a few days if they practice seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And then we bring them here and show them the real ship."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "One step at a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Fifteen days left, we need to move fast."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "16."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She walks over to her computer and opens the game."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Let's build a spaceship."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "12",
      "text": "INT. FARMHOUSE - LIVING ROOM - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah sits at her computer. Kade stands behind her, watching. The AI device hovers nearby, its glow illuminating their faces."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "On screen: the game's ship building interface. Complex, detailed, with thousands of customization options."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Okay. I need dimensions."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Length: forty-seven point three meters. Width: twenty-one point eight meters. Height: twelve point four meters."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah's fingers fly across the keyboard, entering data."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Weapon systems?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Four independent operator stations. Primary armament: dual plasma rail- guns. Secondary: missile arrays, sixteen ship-killer class, sixteen anti-fighter class. Point defense grid. Electronic warfare suite."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The game doesn't have plasma rail- guns."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIP'S AI"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then use the high-velocity energy weapons with minimal projectile drop."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She continues working. The ship takes shape on screen\u2014a digital echo of Talon-7."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "How long will this take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "17."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "An hour, maybe two. Getting it perfect will take longer."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Good enough is fine. We need functional, not perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "(candidly)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You've never met serious gamers. They'll notice every detail."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "parenthetical",
      "text": "( smiles )"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then lets build a perfect copy."
    },
    {
      "type": "scene_heading",
      "number": "13",
      "text": "INT. FARMHOUSE - LIVING ROOM - NIGHT"
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "Sarah leans back, stretching. The completed ship rotates on screen\u2014nearly identical to Talon-7."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Done."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "It looks exactly like the real thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "That's the idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She saves the design, uploads it to the game's server."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now I invite them to a private match. Us versus them. They fly this ship, we fly standard fighters."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "You want them to fight us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I want them to want this ship. If they experience how powerful it is, they'll be hooked."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "page_number",
      "text": "18."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Then they practice until they're good, really good."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "The we show them the real thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "action",
      "text": "She sends the invitations."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SARAH (cont'd)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Now we wait again."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "KADE"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "I'm starting to hate waiting."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
